        "searchField": "extractfaces tristan-huber extract faces from an assembly by click selection. faces are identified by index within their leaf of the assembly. returns a new assembly with just faces abundance-tool",
        "owner": "tristan-huber",
        "description": "Extract faces from an assembly by click selection. Faces are identified by index within their leaf of the assembly. Returns a new assembly with just faces",
        "contentURL": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tristan-huber/ExtractFaces/master/project.abundance?sanitize=true",
